o_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PingPang Battle", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "ranked", "pingpong", "tabletennis", "sports"], "long_description": "**Grab a paddle and play a quick match \u2014 anytime, with anyone.**\n\nPingPang Battle is lightweight VR table tennis built for fast, friendly rallies. No long tutorials, no waiting: pick up your paddles and you're playing in seconds.\n\n**Play your way**\n- **Solo vs AI** \u2014 face a surprisingly smart opponent with multiple difficulty levels, from gentle warm-up rallies to fierce topspin duels.\n- **Online multiplayer** \u2014 create a room, invite friends, and chat with built-in voice while you play.\n- **Ranked play** \u2014 climb the global ladder with Elo matchmaking and leaderboards.\n\n**Real table tennis feel**\nAuthentic ball physics with topspin and backspin, tuned for satisfying rallies on Quest.\n\n**Make it yours**\n- Unlockable paddle and ball skins\n- Multiple courts, from cozy rooms to floating stadiums\n- AR passthrough mode that puts a table in your real living room\n- Full English and Chinese support\n\nA match takes about 5 minutes \u2014 perfect for a quick break.\n\n**Join our Discord community** \u2014 meet players, find opponents and get the latest news: https://discord.gg/kuU6Kkukc\n\nSee you at the table!", "short_description": "Fast, friendly VR table tennis. Challenge a smart AI or rally online with friends around the world \u2014 a quick match takes just 5 minutes. Realistic ball physics, voice chat, ranked ladders and playful courts make every rally feel alive. Free to play, easy to pick up, hard to put down."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBattle/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Chunjun Liang", "support_website_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBattle/support.html", "website_url": "https://chunjunliang.github.io/pingpangBatt